              {
                "config": {
                  "description": "<p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p><ol><li>ISC searches for identities with a similar name or matching email.</li><li>If matches are found, you review them and confirm whether this is a new person.</li><li>If no match applies, a source account is created with a generated username.</li></ol>",
